  "story": {
    "text": "A {TELEGRAM}: Father is very ill in Washington. Marmee must go to him at once, and Mr. Brooke will {ESCORT} her. Jo comes home with twenty-five {DOLLARS} for the journey, and takes off her bonnet: she has sold her {HAIR}, her one {BEAUTY}. That night she {WEEPS} over it in secret.",
